     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">A new version of R/qtl (1.36-6) has been released at its web site</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">(<a href=\"http://www.rqtl.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rqtl.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496840381000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1g-XiuUqmen2B_29daKbwy\">http://www.rqtl.org</a>) and will soon appear on CRAN.</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">There are no major changes, but there were a number of small things,</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">including:</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  Added a function flip.order() for flipping the order of markers on</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  selected chromosomes.</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  Added scanonevar.meanperm and scanonevar.varperm (from Robert Corty)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  for permutation tests with scanonevar().</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  Revised plotPheno (aka plot.pheno) so that one can control the</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  x-axis label and title (also, in a histogram, the breaks).</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  Fixed a bug in scanonevar; was failing with an error about coercing</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  class &quot;A&quot; to a data.frame.</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">A complete list of changes is at <a href=\"http://rqtl.org/STATUS.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rqtl.org/STATUS.txt&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496840381000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0-LJwcsQU4DnAH4B2rVpGo\">http://rqtl.org/STATUS.txt</a></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">Karl Broman</font></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
